              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This dip was a snap to make and was well received by my guests! I didn't use the monosodium glutamate...instead I just used a little more of the spices called for. We served it with carrots as well as tortilla chips and it went well with both. A really nice, versatile dip!"
