              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gail Cobile"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Didn't use the MSG, cut the sour cream by half and slathered this bowlful of super goodness over a slab of salmon before baking . Not a bite left!! DIL asked me to write the recipe down for her before she left. She thinks I'm a genius!! TY for a great recipe!!!!!",
