              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "samantha"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This dip is GREAT! I had mistakenly bought a jar of mayo and now I have use for it! I did make some minor adjustments. I left out MSG and I added 1 tsp of McCormick California style onion powder. Turned out really good! Will use this one again! Thanks for sharing!!",
            "datePublished": "2008-12-05T22:18:22.250Z"
          },
          {
