              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "twilightz34"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This dip was easy to make and delicious. I made it healthier with low-fat sour cream and miracle whip instead of mayo and it still tasted wonderful!",
            "datePublished": "2007-12-04T08:16:51.877Z"
          },
          {
